 afternoon."}], "text": "", "id": 3}, {"correct": true, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "They ought to give us a raise."}], "text": "", "id": 4}, {"correct": true, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "I ought to help her out."}], "text": "", "id": 5}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "I have been bombarded with questions."}], "text": "", "id": 6}, {"correct": true, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "I am supposed to be mentoring her."}], "text": "", "id": 7}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following express things that are supposed to happen?"}]}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 9, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nI really ought to get this done!\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Select all the correct answers. \n"}]}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 10, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn8le14ob01re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nResponding to a difficult customer.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le14ob01re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le14ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le14ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "20", "image": "engenn8le14ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span> : Mr. Farmani. I was expecting your call. Is there anything I can help you with?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span> : Yes, indeed. You might want to take a seat and listen to what I have to say.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span> : Okay. I have a stand-up meeting with my team shortly. We ought to keep it brief.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span> : I'm not satisfied with the immediate media repercussions. I've been receiving threats from Human rights groups. Polygon'd better get their act together and do something about this.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span> : I understand you are having a few problems, Mr. Farmani. Could you give me some more details please?"}, {"time": "33400", "image": "engenn8le14ob01re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span> : I'm very dissatisfied with the service I received. The press release was supposed to alleviate the crisis. Instead, I'm getting bombarded by the press.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>  : I truly understand your concerns. However, together we ought to come up with another plan. I'd better call a meeting to discuss what our next move ought to be.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>  : It's not enough. I'd like to know why nothing has been done so far. This issue had better be addressed before it's too late."}, {"time": "61400", "image": "engenn8le14ob01re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span> : I completely understand how you feel, Mr. Farmani. We ought to come up with a swift and appropriate crisis communication response. We might want to hire another spokesperson.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>  : I'm not sure this is going to address the issue here. My organization's good name ought to be preserved.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>  : We really appreciate the feedback. But we might want to approach this differently.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>  : What do you have in mind? It'd better be good.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>  : I can assure you we'll do our best."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Presenting the Product"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Meeting Etiquette"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Explain customs and appropriate behaviour at work and in different countries, using a wider range of expressions and formulas."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " There are many different ways to make recommendations and express advice. The modal verbs \"had better\", \"ought to\" and \"might\" are most commonly used to make recommendations. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Had better</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "a. Form: subject + had better + bare infinitive (verb without \u2018to')"}, {"type": "text", "content": "b. Meaning: \u201chad better\u201d is very similar in meaning to should but it is stronger because it implies a negative consequence if the advice is not followed. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ought to</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "a. Form: subject + ought to + bare infinitive (verb without \u2018to')"}, {"type": "text", "content": "b. Meaning: \u201cought to\u201d is used for saying what you think is the right thing to do. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Might </span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "a. Form: subject + might + bare infinitive (verb without \u2018to')"}, {"type": "text", "content": "b. Meaning: \u201cmight\u201d is used for making a suggestion or recommendation. It's not as strong as \u201chad better\u201d. We commonly use the verb \u201chave\u201d with \u201cmight\u201d. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You <span class=\"underline\">might want</span>  to take a seat and listen to what I have to say. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I thought you <span class=\"underline\">might want</span>  to see what I have done."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have a meeting so we <span class=\"underline\">ought to</span>  keep this chat short. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You<span class=\"underline\">'d better</span>  get your act together now. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We <span class=\"underline\">ought to do</span>  something about this. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "This problem <span class=\"underline\">had better</span>  be addressed before we lose everything. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We <span class=\"underline\">ought to</span> come up with a swift response. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Dealing With a Difficult Customer"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Dealing with difficult customers is requires a skillful use of language. Here are some expressions you can use to defuse a situation when dealing with angry customers. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer </span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Making the complaint</span> <ul><li>I'm sorry, but I'm not satisfied with ...</li> <li>I've been ... </li> <li>I am very dissatisfied with the service I received. </li></ul> <span class=\"strong\">Insisting</span> <ul><li>It really isn't good enough / It's not enough. </li><li>I'd like to know why ...</li></ul> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Dealing with Complaints </span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Showing understanding</span> <ul><li>I truly understand your concerns. </li><li>I completely understand ...</li> <li>I apologise for ...</li> <li>I understand you're upset about ... </li> <li>We appreciated the feedback. </li> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Getting the facts</span><ul> <li>Could you give me some details, please?</li> </ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Promising action</span><ul><li>We ought to come up with a plan. </li> <li>We might want to approach this differently. </li> </ul>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stand-up meeting"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " meeting in which participants stand in order to keep it short"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have a stand-up meeting with my team shortly."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about a meeting."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "keep it brief"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be concise; to avoid talking a long time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We ought to keep it brief. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "get your act together"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to organize yourself in order to be more effective"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They had better get their act together and do something about this. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dissatisfied (with)"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not pleased with something or someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm very dissatisfied with the service I received."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to alleviate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a problem or injury less severe"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The press release was supposed to alleviate the crisis."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get bombarded"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to be attacked repeatedly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm getting bombarded by the press. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "swift response "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a quick reply"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We ought to come up with a swift and appropriate crisis communication response."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of a situation in which you would need to call customer service (e.g. overcharged on your credit card)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create an imaginary dialogue between a customer and a customer service agent."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the examples for \u201cmaking a complaint\u201d and \u201cshowing understanding\u201d to begin your sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Act out your dialogue with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I create a dialogue."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use appropriate language for making a complaint."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use appropriate language for showing understanding."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice the dialogue with a partner."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le14ob01re1img01.jpg"}]}